# An alternative parameter file that uses the variance ratio, (alpha),
# instead of explicit variance components. Here, (alpha = 2.0), and
# its inverse, (1/alpha = 0.5), is specified under (CO)VARIANCES.
DATAFILE
mr41.dat
NUMBER_OF_TRAITS
1
NUMBER_OF_EFFECTS
2
OBSERVATION(S)
5
WEIGHT(S)

EFFECTS:
2 2 cross
1 8 cross
RANDOM_RESIDUAL VALUES
1.0
RANDOM_GROUP
2
RANDOM_TYPE
add_animal
FILE
mr41.ped
(CO)VARIANCES
0.5
OPTION solv_method FSPAK
OPTION sol se
OPTION store_accuracy 2
